Commit:     Viche Recovery Steward <recovery-steward@viche.local>
CommitDate: Tue Nov 10 17:50:41 2026 +0000

    O1: hold-not-renew for stopped/killed appointments; Clerk gate blocks terminal states
    
    terminal-continuity.sh recover no longer auto-renews stopped/killed:
    null intent is ambiguous (out-of-band human stop looks identical to a
    backend kill), so record a durable unsafe-hold for agent-led Executive
    investigation and exit non-zero instead of silently stranding or blindly
    replacing. Explicit stop intent and live runners never respawn. Failed
    backend turns keep the existing reconciliatory appointment path.
    branch-bootstrap.sh and clerk-liveness.sh route stopped/killed into
    recovery; --gate refuses stopped/killed until reconciled.
    Hermetic coverage: tests/terminal-continuity-o1-smoke.sh (failed
    control, null-intent killed, intentional stop, active runner, unknown,
    Clerk gate killed/healthy/isolated).

